            <ArticleTitle>Multiorgan sarcoidosis presenting with symmetric polyarthralgia, cutaneous vasculitis, and sicca symptoms.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>225-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 49 year old male presented with symmetric polyarthralgia, cutaneous vasculitis, and sicca symptoms. Histological examinations of biopsy specimens from the liver and skin showed sarcoidosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
